# Opposing Force displacer. Measured by vrcardgen, finished by hand.
#
# Part K: "Charge by holding: the spinner spins up with the haptics. The
# secondary fire, which teleports the player, gets a comfort fade. No hand
# reload."
#
# The spinner measures 5.999 radians - 343.7 degrees, which is the number the
# plan quotes, to a tenth. It is declared so that whatever drives the charge
# drives a part rather than an animation; there is nothing here for a hand to
# work, and no feed rules, because a displacer draws from the same reserve the
# gauss does.

weapon v_displacer
match  bones 54  seqs 7  hash 0xfcebfb70

# The bone every position in this card is measured in - the controls, the
# grab points, the chamber, the ejection port. Nothing recorded it until
# the engine had to place a control in the world to ask whether a thumb is
# near it; the simulator never needed one, because it never works in world
# space. Taken from the generator, which has always called this bone the
# WEAPON BODY and is what measured these numbers in the first place.
body   "Bone01"

joint 0  bone "spinner"  hinge  travel 6.00  rest 0
    grab  point 0.00 0.00 0.00  radius 3.0
